  "💾 TRY CLAUDE CODE DESKTOP - BUILD FASTER WITH AI",
  "🤝 SHARE YOUR RESEARCH - STRENGTHEN SCIENTIFIC COMMUNITY",
  "🌍 MYCOLOGY FOR FOOD SECURITY - SUSTAINABLE PROTEIN SOURCE",
  "☮️ FUNGI FOR PEACE - BIOREMEDIATION & CARBON CAPTURE",
  "📚 DOCUMENT YOUR BATCHES - CONTRIBUTE TO OPEN SCIENCE",
  "🔬 LIQUID CULTURE RECIPES - OPTIMIZE YOUR CULTIVATION",
  "🌱 MYCELIUM NETWORKS - NATURE'S INTERNET FOR ECOSYSTEMS",
  "🧬 TRACK STRAINS - BUILD YOUR GENETIC LIBRARY",
  "🏭 INDUSTRIAL MYCOLOGY - MUSHROOMS FOR MATERIALS",
